Backport: drm/apple: add T6030 panel brightness control

Upstream: https://github.com/omacom/linux-aurora/pull/183
Commit: fa224e85a01adbee386542aef7438b6f7e2f2d8c (merged 2026-10-25)
Base: c46d7dcdb8712ea9aeb0ce47b439ffae76371e55 (aurora-2026.10.17.20)

Adapt the port to the pinned kernel's separate legacy/H17P dispatch:
- use the existing firmware selector rather than dcp_is_v14_7_panel;
- route T6030 brightness writes through the shared nits policy;
- initialise the policy, locks and work before 14.7 probe teardown actions,
  and exercise that initializer from the KUnit fixtures;
- retain the separate H17P worker, suspend, resume and backlight ops;
- retain the older swap layout and board records;
- omit the J514C test entry: that board is absent from this kernel.
Includes upstream's KUnit controls under CONFIG_DRM_APPLE_DISPLAY_KUNIT_TEST.

